{"src":"id","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":230100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"id","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8695.907773,"text":"zona sejengan bagaimanapun cara kerjanya sama seperti satu negara dalam hal ini"},{"kind":"text","t":9420.427588,"text":"The monetary zone, however, works the same as a single country in this regard."},{"kind":"audio","t":9535.145225,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9539.504193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":9544.775557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9549.972691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":9551.147052,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17482.732114,"text":"Berada di puncak salah satu gunung di utara kota Mekah, gua tersebut benar-benar terisolasi dari seluruh dunia."},{"kind":"text","t":18486.129140999998,"text":"Perched atop one of the mountains north of the city of Mecca, the cave is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":18596.639826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18602.161576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18607.374880000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":18612.841010000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":18618.396179000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18622.377564000002,"samples":27560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":27299.957318,"text":"Orang-orang sekarang menulis pesan di layar komputer tidak pernah harus menggunakan rautan"},{"kind":"text","t":28052.294207,"text":"People now writing messages on computer screens never have to use a sharpener."},{"kind":"audio","t":28219.920814999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28221.493699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28222.777428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28224.364102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":28224.749754999997,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":38109.593299,"text":"Wisatawan yang berpergian ke negara-negara berpajak yang tinggi kadang-kadang bisa menghemat uang"},{"kind":"text","t":38671.058891,"text":"Tourists traveling to high-tax countries can sometimes save money."},{"kind":"audio","t":38772.477256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38777.377995999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":38782.622519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38786.021734,"samples":24096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":43084.273726,"text":"untuk produk-produk seperti minuman beralkohol dan tembakau."},{"kind":"text","t":43500.0931,"text":"on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":43609.325346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43614.270704999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43619.541449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":43620.05497,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54307.987159,"text":"Tumbuhan membuat makanan mereka dari matahari melalui fotosintesis. Mereka juga memberikan tempat berteduh."},{"kind":"text","t":54792.465834999995,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun through photosynthesis. They also provide shelter."},{"kind":"audio","t":54891.316761999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54896.299541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54902.018847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":54902.332962,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":54965.742371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54966.660704999995,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":63886.344965,"text":"Rumah sakit telah mengikuti protokol untuk mengendali infeksi, termasuk memisahkan pasien dari orang lain untuk menjaga kemungkinan menulari mereka."},{"kind":"text","t":64721.845578,"text":"The hospital has followed infection control protocols, including isolating patients from others to prevent the possibility of infecting them."},{"kind":"audio","t":64843.537990000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64848.674466000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64853.857941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":64859.216483000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64864.41518799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":64869.63213199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64874.372544000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":64874.750198,"samples":11224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71984.38827400001,"text":"Pekerjaan yang dilakukan sebagian besar bersifat teoretis"},{"kind":"text","t":72336.368506,"text":"The work performed was mostly theoretical."},{"kind":"audio","t":72439.41792400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":72441.047177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72441.650087,"samples":20264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"input","t":80420.503553,"text":"Tetapi program ini ditulis untuk mensimulasikan pengamatan yang dilakukan terhadap galaksi Sagittarius."},{"kind":"text","t":81007.001535,"text":"But this program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":81119.10654400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81123.99109400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81129.183648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81134.451442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81137.39617400001,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":91040.845132,"text":"Bahasa resmi Barcelona adalah Katalan dan Spanyol. Hampir separuh penduduknya lebih suka berbicara dalam bahasa Katalan."},{"kind":"text","t":91525.03082300001,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. Nearly half of its population prefers to speak Catalan."},{"kind":"audio","t":91631.362357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91636.296006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":91641.516751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91644.06030900001,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":91712.64839300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91717.776968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91723.10798100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":91723.49683500001,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96186.243317,"text":"Sebagian besar memahaminya dan hampir semua orang mengetahui bahasa Sepanyol."},{"kind":"text","t":96606.612405,"text":"Most understand it and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":96711.64977100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96716.773187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96722.20084800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":96722.46657300001,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103648.93406700001,"text":"Di sebagian area, mau seair selama semenit dianggap cukup, sedangkan di area lainnya butuh beberapa menit."},{"kind":"text","t":104517.734003,"text":"In some areas, a minute of watering is considered sufficient, while in other areas, several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"audio","t":104628.949477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104633.74848800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104639.10748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":104644.44782300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104649.818635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104653.374366,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":110699.74772900001,"text":"Tanaman terlihat paling baik saat berada di lingkungan alami, jadi"},{"kind":"text","t":111255.376997,"text":"Plants look their best when they are in their natural environment, so"},{"kind":"audio","t":111360.28615500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111365.499989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111370.647924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":111371.045368,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":114806.903789,"text":"Tahan godaan untuk mengambil spesimen meskipun cuma satu."},{"kind":"text","t":115322.203049,"text":"Resist the temptation to take specimens, even just one."},{"kind":"audio","t":115431.80616000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115436.870206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":115441.956473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":115442.698051,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126267.886077,"text":"Pada tahun 1920-an, sikap yang berlaku pada kebanyakan warga dan bangsa adalah pasifisme."},{"kind":"text","t":127095.344272,"text":"In the 1920s, the prevailing attitude among most citizens and nations was pacifism."},{"kind":"audio","t":127209.313181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127214.21878000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127219.536943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127224.748127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":127230.07238000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":127230.412134,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138665.749033,"text":"Mosasaurus merupakan predator puncak di masanya sehingga ia tidak takut apapun kecuali sama Mosasaurus"},{"kind":"text","t":139500.280342,"text":"Mosasaurus was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosasaurus."},{"kind":"audio","t":139618.61376900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139624.62986000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139629.59468900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139634.99153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139640.243514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":139640.98457200002,"samples":10760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152394.496279,"text":"Sejak Asuncion berdiri tahun 1537, Paraguay telah berhasil mempertahankan banyak karakter dan identitas aslinya."},{"kind":"text","t":153503.543301,"text":"Since Asuncion was founded in 1537, Paraguay has succeeded in preserving much of its original character and identity."},{"kind":"audio","t":153724.986545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153726.52241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153727.654562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153729.343834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153730.93131800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153732.531362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153733.878089,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":160111.781659,"text":"Penyakit dibawa oleh babi, kemudian berpindah ke manusia lewat nyamuk."},{"kind":"text","t":160707.398471,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, then spreads to humans via mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":160818.338239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160823.13623,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160828.565611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160833.043948,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":170466.13023500002,"text":"Sebagian besar teleskop riset modern merupakan fasilitas raksasa di wilayah terpencil dengan kondisi"},{"kind":"text","t":170986.34882400002,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are giant facilities in remote areas with conditions"},{"kind":"audio","t":171099.28499000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171104.371447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171109.535232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":171114.869484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":171119.464439,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":172912.342764,"text":"atmosfer yang sesuai"},{"kind":"text","t":173076.42255000002,"text":"atmospheric conditions"},{"kind":"audio","t":173175.649611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173176.499717,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":184785.447556,"text":"Orang-orang mungkin tidak menduga bahwa pengertian dan kesabaran juga diperlukan bagi pelancong yang pulang"},{"kind":"text","t":185389.242843,"text":"People might not expect that understanding and patience are also required for returning travelers."},{"kind":"audio","t":185502.435854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":185507.516371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185512.530979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185517.997329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185523.226273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":185523.583837,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":193357.511372,"text":"Jadi notasi itu kemungkinan besar disisikan cuma sebagai level"},{"kind":"text","t":193905.25327000002,"text":"So that notation was most likely left in just as a level."},{"kind":"audio","t":194014.88802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194019.829949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194025.068853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":194026.341102,"samples":13896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":203257.703974,"text":"Namun ada banyak hal tentang burung yang masih terlihat seperti dinosaurus."},{"kind":"text","t":203843.254491,"text":"However, there are many things about birds that still look like dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":203953.57711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203958.70796600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203963.94871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203967.632449,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":216814.29864700002,"text":"Hampir semua pantainya berpasir dengan tempat berenang yang aman, dan sebagian besar mempunyai tempat teduh yang diperoleh dari deretan pohon Pohu Tukawa."},{"kind":"text","t":217958.439283,"text":"Almost all of its beaches are sandy with safe swimming areas, and most have shade provided by rows of Pohu Tukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":218079.13250100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218084.307246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218089.58456000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":218094.810764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218100.109077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218105.235003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":218106.839516,"samples":15192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":225803.551294,"text":"Duval yang menikah dengan dua anak-anak yang sudah dewasa tidak meninggalkan kesan yang mendalam bagi Miller."},{"kind":"text","t":226574.579696,"text":"Duval, who married with two adult children, did not leave a deep impression on Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":226684.368253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226689.584568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226694.65546500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226700.228343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226702.766771,"samples":20128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":227941.60934300002,"text":"yang kisahnya terkait"},{"kind":"text","t":228182.214322,"text":"whose story is related"},{"kind":"audio","t":228275.022759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228276.842909,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"close","t":240205.143044,"code":1005}]}